Error [E0112]: `print` cannot show the lazy view `Iter`<Int>
  --> tests/ui/print_lazy_iter_view.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     print(doubled)
    |           ^^^^^^^
 Why: an iterator adapter hands back a one-pass view, and showing it would consume it
 Fix: materialize it first: add `.to_list()` before printing

